{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14213470","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14213470","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1421347001:1":{"text":"復元した設計図には、ドワーフの古代ルーン文字が書かれてあった。それを見たヘラが眉をしかめる。","source_cn":"图纸复原之后，上面呈现出了矮人特色的古代符文，海拉光是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D06E9BF7F79BD77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421347002:1":{"text":"なくなった設計図で間違いない。この中のいくつかは、あたしが解読したものだよ。でも残りはよく分からないな……","source_cn":"确实是之前丢掉的那份，这里的几个部分还是我破译的，但其...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x314B086A21A2E2EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421347003:1":{"text":"アンタは機械が専門だしな。歴史も古文もちゃんと勉強しなかったんだろ？","source_cn":"我知道，你是搞机械的，不学历史也不学古文是吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8029DB14690042F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421347004:1":{"text":"あはははっ、バカには分からないでしょう？あたいみたいな、ずば抜けた才能と発想力を併せ持つドワーフにしか理解できないのよ！","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈，看不懂了吧？愚蠢！只有像我这样能够举一反三...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69BD8AB295EB8763","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421347005:1":{"text":"何が書かれてるか教えてあげましょうか？","source_cn":"让我告诉你上面写着什么吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D5BAC697E8CAF2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421347006:1":{"text":"それはね、はるか先の敵を貫き、深淵の流炎が集結して生まれた、偉大なる――","source_cn":"这就是：万里逐敌之弓！渊底流焰凝结之弓，伟大而闪耀的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x419F3E710C6BA004","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421347007:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">ドゥアガル</style>。","source_cn":"——<style=highlight>杜恩加尔</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A7F9EE8BB511E87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421347008:1":{"text":"ドゥア――げほっごほっ！な、なんで読めるのよ！？","source_cn":"杜恩——咳咳咳，你、你这个小丫头，你怎么认识？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE2C0A591854E764","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421347009:1":{"text":"読めるどころか、一番下に押されてる印鑑も知ってるぞ……王家主席技師の許可及びヘクトが認める。","source_cn":"我不但认识这些文字，还认识最下方的盖章——皇家大工程师...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A9C443211B2FDED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421347010:1":{"text":"帝国時代の責任者か？","source_cn":"那是帝国时期的负责人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09E248F61229394E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421347011:1":{"text":"ああ。当時、ドワーフたちにはまだ明確な役割分担がなくて、一人何役なんてのは珍しくなかった。","source_cn":"是的，帝国时期的矮人还没有这样明确的分工，很多人都是多面手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06F871297D0406EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421347012:1":{"text":"主席技師はただの技師じゃなく、材料、鍛造、エネルギー供給、プラン設計、そして、その実行や改善すべてを管理する総責任者だよ。","source_cn":"皇家大工程师并不只是工程师，而是能够把控材料、锻冶、能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8825ECAB525B202D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421347013:1":{"text":"ヘクト様も、様々なドワーフの技術に精通していたと言われている。だから主席技師は、ヘクト様の代理人だと称えられてたんだ。","source_cn":"就像传说中赫托就是擅长矮人诸多技艺，无一不精的神明一样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62029B8AAB25EFEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421347014:1":{"text":"様々な分野に精通していた……そんなすごい人が本当にいたなんて……","source_cn":"能横跨这么多的学科，每一种都无比擅长……真的有这样的人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64A86DAAEF36F15A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1421347015:1":{"text":"そうよ、それが帝国の底力よ！一つだけ学べば満足するような、今のドワーフたちと比べたら、遥かに優秀だわ！","source_cn":"这、这就是帝国的底蕴！现在的矮人，学了设计就不学材料，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16257A6ED54A785B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1421347016:1":{"text":"その点に関しては何も言えないが……主席技師の話に戻るぞ。","source_cn":"唔，你的这个观点我无法评价……总之，先说大工程师的事吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4880ED1AF173B06D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1421347017:1":{"text":"オレが知る限り、この人は帝国の記録に残っている最後の主席技師だ。ドゥアガルの名前を付けたのも、これを書いたのもその本人だな。","source_cn":"据我所知，这是帝国最后一任有记载的工程师，他亲自为杜恩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x451930D1CC295B88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1421347018:1":{"text":"これに関する記録は他にもある。オレの家に代々伝わる文献には、もっと詳しいことが書かれてあるぞ。","source_cn":"在许多地方都留下了各类记载，尤其是我家传的文件上，相关...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A75BF1C591C8B8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1421347019:1":{"text":"だからあの時、アンタらを神殿の中にあったドゥアガルの所まで案内できたんだよ。","source_cn":"若非如此，我当时也无法那么准确地引领<style=st...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x09F56A794CE9866C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"だからあの時、アンタらを神殿の中にあったドゥアガルの所まで案内できたんだよ。","female":"だからあの時、アンタらを神殿の中にあったドゥアガルの所まで案内できたんだよ。","variant_male_record_index":"163877","variant_female_record_index":"163878","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1421347020:1":{"text":"でも、この設計図もかなり貴重だ……製造に移る前に提出された、最後のバージョンだな。原本を見たのは初めてだよ。","source_cn":"但这份图确实很珍贵……应该是提交投产前的最终设计图版本...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FEA6436BAEBD21E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1421347021:1":{"text":"な、何を言ってるの？まさか、その技師は……あんたの先祖？","source_cn":"你、你说什么？这个伟大的工程师是，是你的祖先？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8862BCBC62FE5023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1421347022:1":{"text":"ご名答。オレはアンタが思っている以上に長生きしてるし、遥かにたくさんの文献を読んでるんだよ。","source_cn":"是的，小丫头，我活得比你想象得久得多，也阅读过无数的史...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EDC588A52108C78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1421347023:1":{"text":"……今生きているドワーフの中で、アンタが憧れる帝国の繁栄と崩壊に最も近い生き証人は、ひょっとしたら、このオレかもな。","source_cn":"在如今生者之中，或许我是距离你所向往的帝国兴盛与毁灭的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4610D32C15E49402","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1421347024:1":{"text":"絶句するヘラとイーナに向かって、ゾーヤは真剣な面持ちで、サロクディアであなたたちに打ち明けた彼女の過去を語った。","source_cn":"在海拉与伊娜目瞪口呆的注视下，祖娅认真地讲述了在萨洛克...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2598EAD8636847D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1421347025:1":{"text":"帝国の傲り、ヘクトの変容、罪なき命への冒涜……","source_cn":"帝国的傲慢，赫托的变化，对无辜生命的贪婪与利用……","status":"matched","hash_